    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">gene-disease association linked with somatic causal mutation</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">A gene-variant disease association in which a somatic mutation in the gene/protein results in the development or maintenance of the disease, and it may not be passed on to offspring.</dcterms:description>
