  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://semanticscience.org/resource/major-tick-mark">
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">A major tick mark is a tick mark that indicates the position of a specific numeric value and is adjacent to its value label on the value axis, or is one of a pair of tick marks that delineates the boundary of a categorical value indicated by an adjacent category label on the categorical axis.</dcterms:description>
